      {"source_id":"g06-d17-im-src","schema":"pneuma.source.im/v1","provider":"mock","archive_id":"g06-d17-chat-archive","owner_user_ids":["g06-u-lin"],"users":[{"user_id":"g06-u-lin","display_name":"林舟","role":"product","synthetic_address":"lin.zhou@seamlog.test","is_bot":false},{"user_id":"g06-u-wu","display_name":"吴岚","role":"operations","synthetic_address":"wu.lan@bamboo.test","is_bot":false},{"user_id":"g06-person-chenfang","display_name":"陈放","role":"operations","synthetic_address":"chen.fang@bamboo.test","is_bot":false},{"user_id":"g06-u-zhao","display_name":"赵楠","role":"partner","synthetic_address":"zhao.nan@flat.test","is_bot":false}],"conversations":[
        {"conversation_id":"g06-d17-pilot-chat","conversation_type":"group_dm","title":"云麓材料范围问答","member_ids":["g06-u-lin","g06-u-wu","g06-person-chenfang"],"messages":[
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im01","sender_id":"g06-u-wu","sent_at":"2026-03-18T10:18:00+08:00","full_text":"我和项目侧提了云麓这个名字。他们不排斥继续聊受限试点，但这不是同意接入，也不是替谁定了工作。先把它当成一个可以拿来问问题的方向。","thread_id":null,"edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im01","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T10:18:00+08:00","author_role":"operations","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im02","sender_id":"g06-u-lin","sent_at":"2026-03-18T10:24:00+08:00","full_text":"我收到的是“愿意考虑”，不是开始。我先不建目录，也不让样本页改成云麓。昨天那张问题表还在等项目侧回答材料范围和删除怎么核。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im02","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T10:24:00+08:00","author_role":"product","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F03","F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im03","sender_id":"g06-person-chenfang","sent_at":"2026-03-18T10:31:00+08:00","full_text":"别把我直接算进使用者。我可以说现场哪段材料难找，但我还没答应把自己的聊天交出来，也没想好谁该每天看那个副本。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im03","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T10:31:00+08:00","author_role":"operations","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im04","sender_id":"g06-u-wu","sent_at":"2026-03-18T10:39:00+08:00","full_text":"对，三个人只是我拿来解释方案时提到的可能组合，不是名单。林舟、我、陈放各自做什么，以及是不是只有查看权限，都要让三个人分别确认。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im04","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T10:39:00+08:00","author_role":"operations","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im05","sender_id":"g06-u-lin","sent_at":"2026-03-18T10:48:00+08:00","full_text":"我会把提案写成一页问答，不画登录流程：候选项目是不是云麓、三个人是否愿意参与、材料选哪一段、副本是否只读。任何一项没答，都不把另外几项当作默认通过。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im05","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T10:48:00+08:00","author_role":"product","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F03","F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im06","sender_id":"g06-person-chenfang","sent_at":"2026-03-18T11:02:00+08:00","full_text":"我关心的是副本会不会又变成一张要维护的表。只读听着轻一点，可我得先知道材料什么时候被放进去、我能不能指出一段不该在里面。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im06","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T11:02:00+08:00","author_role":"operations","content_class":"ambiguous","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F03","F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im07","sender_id":"g06-u-wu","sent_at":"2026-03-18T11:16:00+08:00","full_text":"这正是还没定的部分。我们今天不替你回答，也不把“受限”写成你已接受。项目侧愿不愿意给材料、谁负责说明删除，都要跟这件事一起问。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im07","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T11:16:00+08:00","author_role":"operations","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F03","F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im08","sender_id":"g06-u-lin","sent_at":"2026-03-18T11:24:00+08:00","full_text":"我下午只把问题排顺序，先不发所谓确认页。车也要送去保养，回来再看有没有具体回复；没有回复时，我不会把聊天里的沉默写成同意。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im08","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T11:24:00+08:00","author_role":"product","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F06","F07"],"continuity_ids":["C02","C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im09","sender_id":"g06-person-chenfang","sent_at":"2026-03-18T11:31:00+08:00","full_text":"行。等你有具体问题再发我；别发一大段“试点说明”让我猜该回哪句。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im09","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T11:31:00+08:00","author_role":"operations","content_class":"noise","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":[],"continuity_ids":[]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im10","sender_id":"g06-u-wu","sent_at":"2026-03-18T11:38:00+08:00","full_text":"我也只转具体问题。云麓这个方向先留在候选栏，今天没有日期、没有导入、没有谁已经答应。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im10","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T11:38:00+08:00","author_role":"operations","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im11","sender_id":"g06-u-lin","sent_at":"2026-03-18T11:46:00+08:00","full_text":"好。我先把“未决定”留在开头，免得后来只截走“云麓”和“只读”两个词。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im11","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T11:46:00+08:00","author_role":"product","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im12","sender_id":"g06-person-chenfang","sent_at":"2026-03-18T11:51:00+08:00","full_text":"那就先这样。我去现场了，晚上不保证看手机。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im12","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T11:51:00+08:00","author_role":"operations","content_class":"noise","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":[],"continuity_ids":[]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im19","sender_id":"g06-u-lin","sent_at":"2026-03-18T11:57:00+08:00","full_text":"我下午翻了停车卡背面才发现店里把取车联系人留成空格，得明早再补；这和云麓聊天无关。工作这边我只会把吴岚的原句留在候选栏，等她自己决定要不要转具体问题。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im01","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im19","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T11:57:00+08:00","author_role":"product","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F03","F07"],"continuity_ids":["C03"]}}},
