          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im13","sender_id":"g06-u-zhao","sent_at":"2026-03-18T14:08:00+08:00","full_text":"车送进去了吗？我下午在棚里录音，晚点才回。借你的那辆钥匙还在门边盒子里。","thread_id":null,"edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im13","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T14:08:00+08:00","author_role":"partner","content_class":"noise","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F06"],"continuity_ids":["C02"]}}},
          {"message_id":"g06-d17-im14","sender_id":"g06-u-lin","sent_at":"2026-03-18T14:16:00+08:00","full_text":"送了。店里在单子上列了基础检查的胎压、液体和灯，但那只是准备检查的项目，没有任何结果，也没说会加做什么。我的车留在那里，今天不能取。","thread_id":"g06-d17-im13","edited_at":null,"reactions":[],"authorship":{"authored_id":"g06-d17-im14","occurred_at":"2026-03-18T14:16:00+08:00","author_role":"product","content_class":"signal","links":{"story_beat_ids":["D17"],"fact_ids":["F06"],"continuity_ids":["C02"]}}},
